        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Turn a Logo into Print-Ready Vector\n\nTraces a raster logo into SVG paths. A vector mark scales to any size a printer, sign maker or embroiderer asks for.\n\n**How it works:** Drop the logo image into \"1 Photo\". \"2 Trace to SVG\" converts its shapes to vector paths, and \"3 Result\" returns the SVG.\n\n**Try this:** Load a logo with flat colors on a plain background into \"1 Photo\". It traces cleaner than a photographed mark."
        },
